#!/usr/bin/python3
"""deepwork: timed deep work sessions on macOS.

  deepwork [min]          start a session (default 90 minutes)
  deepwork off            end the session now and run the shutdown ritual
  deepwork status         show the current session
  deepwork stats          deep hours today, this week, per goal (--all includes everyone in the log)
  deepwork capture "..."  append a stray thought to the capture file
  deepwork baseline [min] sample activity with no blocking (default 60), to compare with deep work
  deepwork break [min]    (experimental) plan a break (default 10) that starts 5 min from now
  deepwork questions      edit your questions, sounds, music pause and apps to quit in $EDITOR (vim)
  deepwork config         print that settings file
Flags: -y (skip prompts), -g "goal", --dry-run (no apps quit, no DND,
isolated state in ~/.deepwork-dryrun, nothing written to the real log).
"""
